Remove Old Config :
openvpn3 config-remove --config MyITSVPN

Import New Config :
openvpn3 config-import --config /home/hilmi/myitsvpn-nrp@student.its.ac.id.ovpn --name MyITSVPN --persistent

Adjust Settings (allow compression) :
openvpn3 config-manage --config MyITSVPN --allow-compression yes

Start VPN Session : (auth username=nrp@student.its.ac.id, auth password={passwordmyits})
openvpn3 session-start --dco true --config MyITSVPN

See Active VPN Sessions :
openvpn3 sessions-list

Disconnect VPN Session Manually :
openvpn3 session-manage --session-path /net/openvpn/v3/sessions/{fill this} --disconnect

